	)
	(text "Ch 1: string bottom LSO-LS: OV lockout trip 1142 V (1114-1170), release 1119 V; 1OUT low pulls COMP low through a BAT54.\nCh 2: overload timer from COMP: trips when COMP > 3.89-4.06 V (34-88 W out); overload timer: 91-189 ms at full COMP. 2OUT latches through a BAS16 and turns\nthe 2N7002 on SS on until VDD reaches UVLO (VREF off resets the latch) -> hiccup."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 150.76 195.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7c56a411-e0c5-5e2d-b80e-6111ed7584ba")
	)
	(text "Each FET holds ~Vin/3 (367 V at 1100 V). Bottom FET: VGS = -I x R_s.\nstart-up current 0.27-0.43 mA. VREF high -> Q pulls SU_G to PGND -> VGS = -VDD -> off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.468 84.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "89e2b2e1-656a-5516-942d-ea874b797cf7")
	)
	(text "LINE_OK low -> BAT54 holds COMP below the 1.15 V offset (zero duty)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 144.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "92a964f0-2a32-5af9-8dc8-56c7c77cbc51")
	)
