	(text "3 sections: start-up gate taps + line sense + OV tap; 367 V each at 1100 V (CRHV2512 3 kV)\nstring compensation (tau 1.0 ms per section)\nBottom: string bottom LSO-LS: OV lockout trip 1142 V (1114-1170), release 1119 V / string bottom LS-PGND: brown-in 228 V (223-232), brown-out 183 V (175-190)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
